non-integer sweep counts
control
  analysis a1 ac from=1k to=100k mode="dec" points=2.5
  analysis a2 ac from=1k to=100k mode="dec" points=2.6
  analysis a3 ac from=1k to=2k mode="lin" points=1.5
  analysis a4 ac from=1k to=2k mode="lin" points=2.5
  analysis a5 ac from=1k to=100k mode="dec" points=5.0/2
  analysis a6 ac from=1k to=2k mode="lin" points=5.0/2
  analysis a7 ac from=1k to=100k mode="dec" points=2*2
endc
